          <description xml:base="https://www.friedemannsommer.com/projects/typescript-postmessagehandler/">&lt;p&gt;A &lt;a rel=&quot;noopener nofollow noreferrer external&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.typescriptlang.org&#x2F;&quot;&gt;TypeScript&lt;&#x2F;a&gt; library that wraps the &lt;a rel=&quot;noopener nofollow noreferrer external&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;developer.mozilla.org&#x2F;en-US&#x2F;docs&#x2F;Web&#x2F;API&#x2F;Window&#x2F;postMessage&quot;&gt;postMessage API&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;
